Hi Tad and Joanna,

Thanks for the input. I think I am looking for something more detailed than Moran's I that could tell more about the relatedness between individual sites, or groups of sites rather than whether or not there is spatial autocorrelation between all of the sites. Maybe a post-hoc test for Moran's I or similar?

Thanks,
Corey

